ent-RUMCConcretePillar = concrete support
    .desc = A column of cast concrete. It holds up the roof farther than a steel beam, and while it stands nothing can be dug down from the level above into its level, over it and around it.
ent-RUMCReinforcedConcretePillar = reinforced concrete support
    .desc = A column of concrete cast around steel rods. It holds up the roof farther than any beam, nothing can be dug down from above into its level within six tiles of it, and the claws and the acid of the xenos do nothing to it.
ent-RUMCConcreteSlab = concrete slab
    .desc = A slab of cast concrete laid on the ground. While it lies nothing can be dug down from the level above into its level, over it and around it.

materials-au14-concrete = concrete
materials-au14-reinforced-concrete = reinforced concrete

au14-pit-tool-held = A concrete support stands on the level below: nothing can be dug down onto it here.
au14-no-dig-examine = Within { $radius } tiles of it nothing can be dug down from the level above into its level while it stands.
construction-step-condition-au14-no-dig-nearby = A concrete support must not stand on the level below.
